[Term]
id: PO:0025597
name: ear infructescence
namespace: plant_anatomy
def: "An infructescence (PO:0006342) in Zea species that bears kernels (i.e. caryopsis fruit; PO:0030104) on a compact ear infructescence axis (PO:0025623) and develops from the ear inflorescence (PO:0020136)." [POC:Laurel_Cooper]
